<title>USA: Publicker Industries sells window firm.</title>
<headline>Publicker Industries sells window firm.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publicker Industries Inc said Friday it has it sold its Masterview Window Co Inc subsidiary for $15.25 million in cash.</p>
<p>The unit was sold to Masterview Acquisition Corp, which was formed by BancBoston Capital, a private equity and mezzanine investment subsidiary of Bank of Boston Corp.</p>
<p>Masterview Window is based in Phoenix, Ariz. It manufactures aluminum windows and sliding glass doors.</p>
</text>
